<p>Multiple open PRs and Issues converge on this meta-skill. PRs <a href="https://github.com/anthropics/skills/pull/1298">#1298</a>, <a href="https://github.com/anthropics/skills/pull/539">#539</a>, and <a href="https://github.com/anthropics/skills/pull/1769">#1769</a> address critical bugs: false-negative trigger evaluations, YAML special-character handling in descriptions, and 0% recall reporting. Issue <a href="https://github.com/anthropics/skills/issues/202">#202</a> (8 comments) argues the skill itself needs a best-practice overhaul. This is the most actively debated skill in the ecosystem.</p>
