</li>
<li><p><strong>Top-of-mind: moderation false positives</strong> — #95500 and #95479 (safety-flag false positives) are a new theme. As models like <code>claude-fable-5</code> tighten safeguards, users who see legitimate work flagged twice in a day are asking for opt-out controls and clearer error surfaces.</p>
</li>
